{
  "_comment": "What 'ready for a beginner' means for Catalan, as requirements rather than as a list of words. The previous beginner-core.txt was whatever occurred to whoever wrote it, and measuring it showed the cost: every subject pronoun, every possessive, every demonstrative, ten of twelve position words and fifteen numbers were present in the lexicon and unreachable at the level that needs them. A learner could not say 'jo', 'aquest', 'sota' or 'tres' in their first week. Requirements can be checked; a list cannot. scripts/verify-beginner-core.ts reports the gap and scripts/tag-beginner-core.ts derives the tag from this file, so the tag is a consequence of the specification and cannot drift from it.",
